    "result_text": "I made the change: fathom is now keel plus momentum plus 68, and the `bin/e2e` acceptance test passes.\n\n- **Server:** `fathom(...)` in `src/main/java/net/officefloor/hq/app/people/PersonView.java` now adds `68L`, and the class comment says so.\n- **Front end:** I only updated the comment on the `fathom` field in `people.service.ts`. The page shows the value the server returns, so no other front-end change was needed.\n\nSome values change along with fathom, because they are built from it:\n- **Per person:** cascade, bow and stern, plus ripple, ballast, keystone, helm, rudder, moor, berth, flood and swell, which build on cascade. Stern goes down by 68; the others go up.\n- **Sheet totals:** the Fathom total, low, top, mean and even counts. The spread stays the same.\n\nI left `pitch` alone. It was also defined as keel plus momentum, so until now it matched fathom; from now on it will be 68 lower.\n\nThe test only checks the fathom column, so the knock-on changes above aren't covered by it.",
